1
00:00:00,330 --> 00:00:00,740
This is what

2
00:00:00,740 --> 00:00:01,600
aisle add does,

3
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:02,360
read from its

4
00:00:02,360 --> 00:00:03,620
own code.

5
00:00:03,760 --> 00:00:04,390
You might think it

6
00:00:04,390 --> 00:00:06,170
just copies a folder.

7
00:00:06,310 --> 00:00:06,980
It is closer to

8
00:00:06,980 --> 00:00:08,320
a careful delivery:

9
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:08,780
look up,

10
00:00:08,780 --> 00:00:10,580
fetch, inspect, shelve.

11
00:00:11,340 --> 00:00:12,860
First, the command asks

12
00:00:12,860 --> 00:00:13,800
the registry site for

13
00:00:13,800 --> 00:00:14,980
the skill list.

14
00:00:15,280 --> 00:00:16,210
Back come the versions,

15
00:00:16,210 --> 00:00:17,290
and a pinned

16
00:00:17,290 --> 00:00:18,130
commit for each.

17
00:00:18,670 --> 00:00:19,510
Then it asks GitHub

18
00:00:19,510 --> 00:00:20,530
for that exact commit.

19
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,010
What comes back

20
00:00:22,010 --> 00:00:22,930
is a tarball.

21
00:00:22,930 --> 00:00:24,370
Nothing is cloned.

22
00:00:24,810 --> 00:00:26,380
Before anything is installed,

23
00:00:26,380 --> 00:00:27,380
the audit engine

24
00:00:27,380 --> 00:00:29,000
reads the files.

25
00:00:29,135 --> 00:00:30,285
It sends back a

26
00:00:30,285 --> 00:00:30,665
grade and a

27
00:00:30,665 --> 00:00:31,885
list of findings.

28
00:00:32,315 --> 00:00:33,315
Only then is the

29
00:00:33,315 --> 00:00:34,695
folder moved in,

30
00:00:34,695 --> 00:00:36,155
and the lockfile updated.

31
00:00:36,767 --> 00:00:37,827
A critical finding

32
00:00:37,827 --> 00:00:38,747
blocks the install,

33
00:00:38,747 --> 00:00:39,947
unless you force it

34
00:00:39,947 --> 00:00:41,167
and type the name.

35
00:00:41,973 --> 00:00:43,073
Downloaded, checked,

36
00:00:43,073 --> 00:00:43,813
never run.
